+| System | Positive open result | Negative control |
+|---|---:|---|
+| 64 parent | SAT, dim 2 with q-leader | \(a=0\): unit ideal |
+| 64 bottom | SAT, dim 1 | \(\kappa=0\): unit ideal |
+| 75 parent | SAT, dim 2 with q-leader | \(a=0\): unit ideal |
+| 75 bottom | SAT, dim 1 | \(\kappa=0\): unit ideal |
+| 108 parent | SAT, dim 1 monic | \(c=0\): unit ideal |
+| 90 level-3 parent | SAT, dim 1 monic | \(c=0\): unit ideal |
+
+Additional collision controls \(d=a\) for 64, \(b_0=a\) for 75, and
+\(U(a)=0\) for 108 reduce to the unit ideal after localization. At the 64
+bottom, separately forcing either discriminant or the resultant to zero also
+does so. These controls check that localization has not accidentally selected
+a zero-leader or collision component.
+
+On this host, the complete small Singular batch took 0.02 s and 11,660 KB
+maximum RSS; the independent SymPy identity/invariant batch took 0.92 s and
