+ \operatorname{ord}_{w=0}
+ \{\bar F_0(w)^5-\bar G_0(w)^3\}=21.                           \tag{6.9}
+\]
+Thus (6.6), including \(h_{21}\ne0\), has a solution.
+
+An exact displayed family is obtained from any pair defined by the permutation
