+An exact displayed family is obtained from any pair defined by the permutation
+triple:
+\[
+ F_\tau(z)=\tau^8F_0(z/\tau),\qquad
+ G_\tau(z)=\tau^{13}G_0(z/\tau),\qquad\tau\in\overline{\mathbf Q}^{\times}.
+                                                                    \tag{6.10}
