+Exact existence is again supplied by a three-point cover. On 21 letters take
+\(\sigma_1=(0\,1\,\ldots\,16)\), fixing 17 through 20, and
+\[
+\begin{split}
+\sigma_0={}&(0,14,3)(1,2,18)(4,13,7)(5,6,19)\\
+            &(8,12,9)(10,11,20)(15,16,17).
+\end{split}                                                    \tag{6.20}
