+\[
+ \beta(z)={F_0(z)^3\over zG_0(z)^2},\qquad
+ \deg F_0=7,\quad\deg G_0=10,                                 \tag{6.21}
+\]
+where \(F_0G_0\) is squarefree and coprime and
