+There is nevertheless an exact non-CAS existence witness. On 40 letters take
+\(\sigma_1=(0\,1\,\ldots\,20)\), fixing 21 through 39, and take
+\(\sigma_0\) to have cycles
+\[
+\begin{split}
+&(0,37,25,20,17),(1,13,2,34,28),(3,30,12,9,22),\\
+&(4,8,24,36,7),(5,29,6,35,26),(10,31,11,39,32),\\
+&(14,16,15,33,21),(18,38,19,23,27).
+\end{split}                                                    \tag{6.7}
+\]
+Define \(\sigma_\infty\) by
+\(\sigma_0\sigma_\infty\sigma_1=1\). Exact integer checks give cycle types
+\[
+ 5^8,\qquad 3^{13}1,\qquad 21\,1^{19},
+\]
+transitivity, and total ramification \(78=2\cdot40-2\). The Riemann existence
