+pole at \(z=0\) and its 21-fold point over 1 at \(z=\infty\). It has the form
+\[
+ \beta(z)={F_0(z)^5\over zG_0(z)^3},\qquad
+ \deg F_0=8,\quad\deg G_0=13,                                 \tag{6.8}
