+and a truncation ending in \(\pi t^{11/4}\). A coherent system for the same
+\(\bar g,\bar f\) gives a common approximate root \(h\):
+\[
+ \bar g=h^4+\alpha_1h^3+\alpha_2h^2+\alpha_3h+\alpha_4,\qquad
+ \bar f=h^3+\beta_2h+\beta_3.
