+ b_0=(7-5\theta)a,\qquad d_0=\theta a.
+\]
+
+Then
+
+\[
+ p=(z-a)^3(z-b_0),\qquad
+ q=\lambda\pi(z-a)(z-b_0)(z-d_0),
+\quad c=-20\lambda ab_0d_0.                                  \tag{5.7}
+\]
