+For a bottom prototype let \(\rho^2=6\), \(s\ne0\), and
+
+\[
+\begin{split}
+ G(z)&=z^3+sz^2+s^2(\tfrac38-\tfrac{\rho}{24})z
+                   +s^3{4-\rho\over96},\\
+ F(z)&=z^2+\tfrac34sz+s^2{6-\rho\over32},\\
