+\[
+ g(\pi)=\pi G(\pi^2),\quad\deg G=10,\qquad
+ f(\pi)=F(\pi^2),\quad\deg F=7.                                \tag{6.16}
+\]
+
+The source equation is \(D(3,2,g,f)=\kappa\), equivalently its negative
+\(2fg'-3gf'=-\kappa\). The exact Padé system is
