+\[
+ F_0=z^7+z^6+\alpha z^5+f_4z^4+\cdots+f_0,\qquad
+ G_0=z^{10}+g_9z^9+\cdots+g_0
+\]
+as an element of \(K\). Reduction modulo \(\Phi\) verifies the constant
